      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָזִיד</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>coisa cozida ou fervida, guisado</strong>; absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:29\" href=\"/Genesis.25.29\">Gn 25:29</a> + 4 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">נְזִיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:34\" href=\"/Genesis.25.34\">Gn 25:34</a>;—uma espécie de alimento cozido à base de leguminosas, objeto de <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫זֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:29\" href=\"/Genesis.25.29\">Gn 25:29</a> (ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, זוּד\" href=\"/BDB,_זוּד\", dir=\"rtl\">זוּד</a> <strong>Hifil.</strong>); definido no v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:34\" href=\"/Genesis.25.34\">34</a> como <span dir=\"rtl\">נְזִיד עֲדָשִׁים</span> (ver <span dir=\"rtl\">עדשׁ</span>); objeto de <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשֵּׁל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:38\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.38\">2 K 4:38</a>; cozido numa <span dir=\"rtl\">סִיר</span> v. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:39\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.39\">39</a> cf. v. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:40\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.40\">40</a>; mencionado, aparentemente, como alimento comum, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:12\" href=\"/Haggai.2.12\">Hg 2:12</a>.",
