      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָכָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: ser límpido, limpo, puro</strong>, sempre em sentido moral <strong>(</strong>assírio <em>zakû</em> Zim<sup>BP</sup>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּכָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܟܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܟܺܝ</span>; cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَكَا</span> <em>ser brilhante</em> (de fogo), <em>penetrante</em> (de odor); <em>ser perspicaz, de inteligência rápida</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Imperfeito, 3.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְכֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:14\" href=\"/Job.15.14\">Jb 15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 25:4\" href=\"/Job.25.4\">25:4</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזְכֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:6\" href=\"/Psalms.51.6\">ψ 51:6</a>; 1.ª pessoa singular interrogativa <span dir=\"rtl\">הַאֶזְכֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:11\" href=\"/Micah.6.11\">Mi 6:11</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>ser limpo, puro</em>, do homem, aos olhos de Deus, <a data-ref=\"Job 15:14\" href=\"/Job.15.14\">Jb 15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 25:4\" href=\"/Job.25.4\">25:4</a> (em ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יצדק</span>; cf. também <span dir=\"rtl\">זַכּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:15\" href=\"/Job.15.15\">15:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 25:5\" href=\"/Job.25.5\">25:5</a>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>ser inocente, ser justificado</em> = ser considerado justo, reto, de Deus, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:6\" href=\"/Psalms.51.6\">ψ 51:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תצדק</span>), <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:11\" href=\"/Micah.6.11\">Mi 6:11</a>.<br><strong>Piel.</strong>  Perfeito, 1.ª pessoa singular <span dir=\"rtl\">זִכִּיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:13\" href=\"/Psalms.73.13\">ψ 73:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.9\">Pr 20:9</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְזַכֶּה־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:9\" href=\"/Psalms.119.9\">ψ 119:9</a>:—<em>tornar</em> ou <em>manter limpo, puro</em>, objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבָבִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:13\" href=\"/Psalms.73.13\">ψ 73:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרְחַץ כַּפָּ֑י</span>), objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.9\">Pr 20:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">טָהַרְתִּי</span>); objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת־אָרְחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:9\" href=\"/Psalms.119.9\">ψ 119:9</a>.<br><strong>Hitpael.</strong>  Imperativo, masculino plural <span dir=\"rtl\">הִזַּכּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.16\">Is 1:16</a> <em>purificai-vos</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רַחֲצוּ</span>);—sobre a forma, cf. Ges<sup>§ 54, 2, b, Rem.</sup> Kö<sup>Lgb. i, 345, 534</sup> Sta<sup>§ 129 d</sup>.",
