      "preview": "זַךְ: adjetivo: puro, limpo, justo.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זַךְ</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo: puro, limpo</strong>; absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">זַךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 8:6\" href=\"/Job.8.6\">Jb 8:6</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָ֛ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:20\" href=\"/Exodus.27.20\">Ex 27:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.2\">Lv 24:2</a>; feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">זַכָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:34\" href=\"/Exodus.30.34\">Ex 30:34</a> + 2 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  literalmente, <em>puro</em>, isto é, sem mistura, livre de substâncias estranhas, de azeite de oliva <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:20\" href=\"/Exodus.27.20\">Ex 27:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.2\">Lv 24:2</a>, de olíbano <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:34\" href=\"/Exodus.30.34\">Ex 30:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.7\">Lv 24:7</a> (todos P e H).<br><strong>2.</strong>  figuradamente, <em>puro, limpo, justo</em> (somente Jó e Provérbios):—do homem <a data-ref=\"Job 8:6\" href=\"/Job.8.6\">Jb 8:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשָׁר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Job 33:9\" href=\"/Job.33.9\">33:9</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלִי פָ֑שַׁע</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חַף</span>) como substantivo = <em>o puro, justo</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזַךְ יָשָׁר פָּעֳלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.8\">Pr 21:8</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">וָזָר֑</span>, ver respectivo verbete); do modo de vida <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־דַּרְכֵי־אִישׁ זַךְ בְּעֵינָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.2\">Pr 16:2</a>; do modo de agir <span dir=\"rtl\">(פָּעֳלוֹ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.11\">20:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשָׁר</span>); de doutrina <span dir=\"rtl\">(לִקְחִי)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:4\" href=\"/Job.11.4\">Jb 11:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּר הייתי</span>); de oração <a data-ref=\"Job 16:17\" href=\"/Job.16.17\">16:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא חָמָס בְּכַפָּ֑י</span>).",
