      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זִכְרִי</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> 𝔊 Ζεχρει, Ζαχρι, etc., exceto como abaixo:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  um rubenita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.16\">1 Ch 27:16</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  um judaíta <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.16\">2 Ch 17:16</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  levitas: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:21\" href=\"/Exodus.6.21\">Ex 6:21</a> (P). <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.25\">1 Ch 26:25</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  um asafita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.15\">1 Ch 9:15</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.17\">Ne 11:17</a> onde se lê <span dir=\"rtl\">זכרי</span> (por <span dir=\"rtl\">זַבְדִּי</span>, ver respectivo verbete); cf. também abaixo <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, זַכּוּר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_זַכּוּר\">זַכּוּר</a> <strong>3 b.</strong><br><strong>4.</strong>  um sacerdote <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.17\">Ne 12:17</a> (𝔊L Ζαχαριας).<br><strong>5.</strong>  benjamitas: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.19\">1 Ch 8:19</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.23\">23</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.27\">27</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.9\">Ne 11:9</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  pai de um capitão no tempo de Joiada <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.1\">2 Ch 23:1</a> (𝔊 Ζαχαρια, 𝔊L Ζεχρι).<br><strong>7.</strong>  homem valente de Efraim <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.7\">2 Ch 28:7</a> (𝔊 Ἐζεχρει, 𝔊L Ζαχαριας).",
