      "preview": "זְכַרְיָהוּ: nome próprio masculino: Zacarias.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְכַרְיָהוּ</span></big>  mais frequentemente <span dir=\"rtl\">זְכַרְיָה</span> <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong>sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">ידֿכראל</span> DHM<sup>Epigr. Denkm. 43</sup><strong>)</strong> 𝔊 Ζαχαρια(ς), etc.:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, rei de Israel, filho de Jeroboão II, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.8\">2 K 15:8</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.29\">14:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.11\">15:11</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, pai da mãe de Ezequias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.1\">2 Ch 29:1</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.2\">2 K 18:2</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, contemporâneo de Isaías <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.2\">Is 8:2</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, um rubenita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.7\">1 Ch 5:7</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span>, um benjamita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.37\">1 Ch 9:37</a> (𝔊 Ζαχαρια, A Ζαχχουρ 𝔊L Ζεχρει) = <span dir=\"rtl\">זָ֑כֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.31\">1 Ch 8:31</a> (ver I. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, זֶ֫כֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_זֶ֫כֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">זֶכֶר</a>]).<br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, um manassita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.21\">1 Ch 27:21</a> (𝔊 Ζαβδειου, 𝔊L Ζαχαριου).<br><strong>7.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, um filho de Josafá <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.2\">2 Ch 21:2</a>.<br><strong>8.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span>, um capitão de Josafá <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.7\">2 Ch 17:7</a>.<br><strong>9.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>, mestre de Uzias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.5\">2 Ch 26:5</a>.<br><strong>10.</strong>  levitas, <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.18\">1 Ch 15:18</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span> v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.5\">16:5</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.25\">1 Ch 24:25</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.2\">1 Ch 26:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.14\">14</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.11\">1 Ch 26:11</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.14\">2 Ch 20:14</a>. <strong>f.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.13\">2 Ch 29:13</a> (𝔊 Ἀζαριας, A Ζαχαριας, assim 𝔊L). <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span>: <strong>g.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.21\">1 Ch 9:21</a>. <strong>h.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.12\">2 Ch 34:12</a>. <strong>i.</strong>  um asafita <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.35\">Ne 12:35</a>.<br><strong>11.</strong>  sacerdotes, <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריהו</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">1 Ch 15:24</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.8\">2 Ch 35:8</a>. <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span>: <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.20\">2 Ch 24:20</a> (𝔊 Ἀζαριαν; 𝔊L Ζαχαριαν; provavelmente referido em Mt 23.35, onde aparentemente há confusão com <strong>f</strong>). <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.12\">Ne 11:12</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:41\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.41\">Ne 12:41</a>. <strong>f.</strong>  o conhecido profeta <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.1\">Zc 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.1\">7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.8\">8</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.16\">Ne 12:16</a> [cf. aramaico <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:1\" href=\"/Ezra.5.1\">Ezr 5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">6:14</a>].<br><strong>12.</strong>  exilados que retornaram, <span dir=\"rtl\">זכריה</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:3\" href=\"/Ezra.8.3\">Ezr 8:3</a> e talvez v. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" href=\"/Ezra.8.16\">16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.4\">Ne 8:4</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:11\" href=\"/Ezra.8.11\">Ezr 8:11</a> (𝔊 Ἀζαριας, A Ζαχαριας, assim 𝔊L). <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:26\" href=\"/Ezra.10.26\">Ezr 10:26</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  um homem de Judá <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.4\">Ne 11:4</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  <em>idem.</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.5\">Ne 11:5</a> (𝔊 Θηζεια, א Θηδεια, A Ζαχαριου, assim 𝔊L).",
